# Everything in this directory is a TEST OUTPUT, regenerated by export/test/test_lammps.jl
# and export/test/test_mpi.jl on every run: the generated LAMMPS inputs, the geometry those
# inputs write out for the Julia side to read back, the dumps and the logs.  None of it is
# an input to anything, so none of it is tracked -- previously the generated *.lmp files
# were, and every test run showed up as a dirty working tree.
*.lmp
*.data
*.dump
*.restart
log.*
two_ranks/
